<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Banco Santander Chile started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Banco Santander Chile started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co has started coverage of Banco Santander Chile with an outperform rating, a source at the firm said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed on Monday at 14-5/8 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
